{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "42b26d58cc860b6a71d0b8900e663c54fdf97a65cc2da8598ebb7f0f2d2f4b5b", "ja": "無意識×孤独", "zh": "无意识×孤独", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0a2b1ff7d680f8e2e5d31a4c12dcf27d09d6befb62ac2293789255741aafe158", "ja": "いよいよPV撮影が始まり、セットの豪華さに\n驚く一同。ロコと桃子も手伝いに加わり、\n現場はいい雰囲気に。だがそんな中、\nひとり離れたところへと歩いていく志保に\n気づくプロデューサー。", "zh": "PV正式开始拍摄，\n众人见到豪华布景无不感到震惊。\nROCO与桃子也前来协助，\n拍摄现场的气氛和乐融融。\n但此时，制作人发现志保独自走向远处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8713006254d6709e2d502bb390cd1bb5edfe564c0e38600ce229f35de92716be", "ja": "（いよいよ今日から、EScapeのPV撮影だ。\nみんな、準備はできているかな……）", "zh": "（今天要开始拍摄『EScape』的PV了。\n不晓得大家都准备好了吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "21df03d72c6377f071e11ba6d3a5cfe5fd2ac202553c584af097b3e94f4def3c", "ja": "これは……とても豪華なセットです。\nまるで本当に、近未来に来てしまったかのようですね。", "zh": "这布景……真是豪华，\n仿佛真的来到近未来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "354b41e717f0b2a0f7ddfe87c8ceb095f98b0dc24f29d04b1af586e24a863158", "ja": "こんなに大がかりな撮影だったんですね……。\nなんだか少し、緊張してきました。", "zh": "原来是这么大规模的拍摄……\n总觉得我有点紧张起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1e7feb76289b75ffa52a459ae65e6582ac93c6750560dc1967c2cfb3e4f8080d", "ja": "ああ、すごいスケールだな。\nこれなら、きっといいPVになるぞ！", "zh": "嗯，拍摄规模真的很惊人。\n这下一定能拍出很出色的PV！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c00c76a1f52562afe9831f28eb9097a3582b2bb8613f948236754348fd03650c", "ja": "み……みなさん、落ち着いていますね……。\n私、どうしたら……。", "zh": "各……各位还真冷静……\n我该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "75eeebd8d07a0be75a49a59c2462d12a44b28cdc9103e3c8ab4f9b6562f2dff5", "ja": "大丈夫です、白石さん。\nここまでのレッスンは、予定どおりです。", "zh": "放心，白石。\n至今为止的训练都有按照计划进行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "b92429f4f951b112007ddc9ee6bf9e6e52a22379f41fecd715d98089475c68fe", "ja": "今の私達なら、完璧なアンドロイドを演じられるはず。\nだから、大丈夫れす。……すみません、噛みました。", "zh": "如今的我们，肯定能演出完美的仿生人。\n所以不用担薰……抱歉，我吃螺丝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "49fd87ce9c281f34e3f7e97fad0f8a3cc08f0e9952714fdb76c517e137bd96f2", "ja": "瑞希さん……ふふっ。", "zh": "瑞希……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dbc78ca5d65302a8b38bec657661270c58ae9fac943c1c718a7fa71c2d75ec30", "ja": "ふふっ。", "zh": "呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "3050c13d87fa4a59a0a9248e60f14ed37be9ba96cae7faf8a743ef72cc3b5caf", "ja": "そうですね。むしろ、楽しみになってきました。\n緊張してるくらいの方が、いい仕事ができるかと。", "zh": "说得也是，我反而开始期待了。\n而且带着紧张感，也许能表现得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c88dd6a4c78b088f24322fb87f8aebd0b99b884f4d74559466c8c072fcbedd96", "ja": "（瑞希のおかげで、2人とも肩の力が抜けたみたい\nだな。このまま撮影開始といきたいところだが……）", "zh": "（多亏瑞希，她们两个好像没那么紧张了。\n希望能保持这个状态开始拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dbb9b1eba59a36505b1aab7290951d7218348a82b3685ae0cb93b4efce7a2084", "ja": "おはようございます、765プロです。\n本日はよろしくお願いいたします！", "zh": "早安，我们是765艺能。\n今天还请各位多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "bc4e77e6407e004b7c8b2f83de56da665396ef3fa2d64a5a518fd7a82fdcab61", "ja": "おはようございます。", "zh": "早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
