{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bc4e77e6407e004b7c8b2f83de56da665396ef3fa2d64a5a518fd7a82fdcab61", "ja": "おはようございます。", "zh": "早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1015_kantoku", "source_sha256": "e0622becb55b71aa5d5e909f3df6aaff36cbfd5c97b116c9ee1b5e3a13205ab9", "ja": "おはようございます！　いや～、さすがだね。\n3人とも、アンドロイド役はもう完璧みたいだね！", "zh": "早安！哎呀～真叫人佩服。\n你们三个好像已经完美掌握仿生人的角色了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dfd47d4084df42f884e38e40f425c7071cd26d5277939b6f54d27605f8e76106", "ja": "あの、それはどういう……。", "zh": "请问，您这话的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "b578e324468235fbe4051090c5580d0eb07601770bc21fc1acb94d8ea9a21655", "ja": "おはようございます！", "zh": "早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "bc4e77e6407e004b7c8b2f83de56da665396ef3fa2d64a5a518fd7a82fdcab61", "ja": "おはようございます。", "zh": "早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e0d524e5725d12949a0e35d15455b52355e54cee186058fa2f3f79991217f787", "ja": "えっ！？\nな、なんでここに、ロコと桃子がいるんだ？", "zh": "咦！？\n为、为什么ROCO跟桃子会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "fb1d3b510d585e63080d1ec52a140b45c77f03e04cba407d663bd3018df91aa3", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}聞いてないんですか？\nロコは今回アートスタッフとして参加してるんですよ！", "zh": "咦？{$P$}没听说吗？\nROCO这次是以Art Staff的身分参加拍摄喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "906f8f41abbf59cf6be7d43e877d9467c7cd4599714c4add650170941474d9be", "ja": "社長さんから、じきじきに頼まれたんだよね。\nちなみに桃子は、演技指導係だからね♪", "zh": "还是社长先生亲自拜托的呢。\n顺便一提，桃子负责指导演技喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "bcd1746e2bc52e4102545eca6111206bbe69c607bc9c34c34c49e7a8fb3ffe68", "ja": "（社長……せめて事前に一言、お願いします……）", "zh": "（社长……拜托你至少事前跟我说一声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6cffa05f7a15570937bbad15135919345d551e6cc6ea01846cc125d6f27bd12e", "ja": "けど、{$P$}も、それならそうと\n早く言ってくれればよかったものを……。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}也真是的，\n既然如此为何不早点告诉我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "f8bfbea943f46cdbaaac77e6bf84fd1ef105f4d8eafc402eb4d06083526c34dc", "ja": "まさか{$P$}さん、\n何も知らなかったんですか？", "zh": "难道{$P$}先生，\n你也完全不知情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1b10d1edc14e51b949ef2b16a5ab85e572013073eef460e188d73816f68792f8", "ja": "え、えーっと、どうだったかな……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛，我不太清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "a921f3e3552236034ef9f57fbf7c70649f6ea0dba224c3bce9405a79369487db", "ja": "そうでしたか。こちらこそ、よろしくお願いします。\nおふたりがいてくれて、とても心強いです。", "zh": "原来是这样。我才是，请你们多多指教了。\n有你们两位助阵，让人非常安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "17a9138ea1641132d9174c07c446435ca083067f4143bad0d24e3e5ae1e79ab8", "ja": "ふふ、任せてください！　ミズキ、何か希望があれば\n言ってくださいね。ロコがヒアリングします！", "zh": "呵呵，包在ROCO身上！\n瑞希有什么要求尽管说，ROCO会Hearing！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "562959f63bca1a19e8eb6bffa2371931ed88140f000629c7bc87a91ba68e5b52", "ja": "へえ……ロコさん、人の意見とかちゃんと聞くんだね。\nちょっと意外だったかも。", "zh": "是喔……ROCO姊原来也会倾听别人的意见，\n感觉有点意外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "f81f9b2d0f689949ea2f959ad2116d410a94d2d072d3103ae99c3defaf1c97a9", "ja": "フフフ……クライアントの希望を聞きつつ自分のセンス\nを見せるのが、プロフェッショナルの仕事ですよ！", "zh": "呵呵呵……了解Client的要求，同时展现自己的Sense，\n这样才是Professional的工作喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "62c4818e0f2f02dcc0399e67468fd0cffc2238d638e898306ee55f0707f22db9", "ja": "では、ロコは仕事に取りかかりますね！", "zh": "那么，ROCO去工作啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "c3fc248d4a16f6710bec18038ca9214a72ada32201b5d48ab15a119cd9faac0d", "ja": "というわけで……撮影が始まるまでの間、\n桃子がビシビシ指導するから、覚悟してね！", "zh": "事情就是这样……在拍摄开始前，\n桃子会严格指导大家，要有心理准备喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "933816e309b71dc72ed9bc571eb796c699ddc088b59ae264a07ac37379dac250", "ja": "ええ。よろしくお願いします、周防さん。", "zh": "好的。请你多多指教，周防。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "d5b5cff247500721ad543b3148d03cabc3412b36733e17ccd10ff26d0a23514f", "ja": "そう、ありがとう。桃子は私達より、\n映像の経験が多いだろうから、助かるわ。", "zh": "我明白了，谢谢你。\n桃子应该比我们更有拍片经验，很高兴有你的帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "c5a638bfd74203b3e3eebdc8e8031f318bc56c048efcc6a70134d4233f4d17a9", "ja": "ふふん、まかせて！　まずは心構えから……こほん。\nいい？　セリフなしのお芝居は、カンタンじゃないよ。", "zh": "哼哼，交给桃子吧！首先从心态开始……咳咳。\n听好啰？没有台词的剧本演起来可不简单喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "43e3128f23a287ca5c5f92adff71a955e63e6f169fa47fce01c66a8ed526bb3f", "ja": "表情から指先の動きひとつまで、計算しないと！\nまずはカメラの代わりに、桃子がチェックするからね♪", "zh": "从表情到手指的每个动作都要事先计算好！\n就先由桃子代替摄影机，来帮大家确认吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1037_025roc", "source_sha256": "5c21c9b1db55bd10a6a7ee70167b8e1121617ae28f648740be129019d3ebeca4", "ja": "なるほど～。モモコが最近、アクトの教本を\n読んでいたのは、そのためだったんですね♪", "zh": "原来如此～桃子最近一直在看Act的教学书，\n就是为了指导大家啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "078e0de1f2576c8671a8035941ee8b4b96293c485ba8b6758c9fd51172d25160", "ja": "えっ！？　ち、ちょっとロコさん！\n桃子は少し復習してただけで、えっと……。", "zh": "咦！？等、等一下，ROCO姊！\n桃子只是稍微复习一下而已，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "b5083860c619901740f5f8744e5c763e097d3abb170567bd6fe9d1a085894687", "ja": "だ、だって瑞希さんや志保さんや紬さんに\n教えるんだから、適当なこと言えないし……！", "zh": "因、因为要教瑞希姊、志保姊跟䌷姊，\n桃子总不能随便乱说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b5717108507881f325db1a5a3e9515792e2de181ca233baad5f8b69367abd97", "ja": "周防さん。私達のために……。\n感動しました。", "zh": "周防，你居然为了我们……\n我真感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1041_044miz", "source_sha256": "71fdd68a6356a16b63585cadcaa8773a352b7c25b61ecb5841e6c30dd4b78970", "ja": "ありがとうございます。是非、見てください。\n……ワタシタチノ、エンギ。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n请你务必看看……我们的演技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "93ae74c8a70d90fde56449982da79f60721ba59a879f160e3678a9c9e2253c9f", "ja": "ええ……。\n周防さん、よろしくご指導ください。", "zh": "是呀……\n周防，还请你多加指导。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1043_049mom", "source_sha256": "0e23fcdf703434be11526a1eec598a6f7a6b8234334e81b8fe3eda48b0eb33fe", "ja": "う、うん！　桃子にまかせれば、心配いらないよ！\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "好、好的！只要交给桃子，就不用担心啰！\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "03625ca4f89845851551cf39b38d495e753276e0b8a72f35168219cb9ddbd6e9", "ja": "（桃子の演技力は確かだし、任せても平気だろう。\n真面目な3人に、指導係の存在はちょうどいいかもな）", "zh": "（桃子确实演技精湛，交给她想必没问题。\n对于生性认真的那三人来说，有人指导或许正好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "75df0f07bfbf5cad71745940ab41fd6a972d6c33f8962277b59dd6643e9eb85c", "ja": "（結局、社長の采配が的確だったってことか。\n見習わないと……ん？）", "zh": "（到头来，看来社长的指示是正确的。\n我得向他看齐才行……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "336f23f904db6fe192e79c80bd470c54a90db33609f33e4529e95d5c708c5d68", "ja": "……はぁ。", "zh": "……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "1aeae5df3bc8b601839d1a0371016dd3de25ec3930a08abfaa6ec7ef594afde2", "ja": "（志保が一人、はなれた所に歩いていく……？）", "zh": "（志保独自走远了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "564906ec51f05bf6b31ef863ddaff22a69eb0025b459c859e4148c88fa9d6bb0", "ja": "志保、どうしたんだ？\nみんなと一緒に演技指導を受けないのか？", "zh": "志保，怎么了？\n你不跟大家一起接受演技指导吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "fbe3ccb7fb7c2ff4a87879e0a0f878d6446450629dbccfdf89fe4a416187bea5", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n別に、なんでもないです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n没事，我没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_03_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "ff0f7a19d7a9fb18967f160b32a5750321cbe34c6a5537bd27f769eae2d1018d", "ja": "他に用事はないんですか？　私、ちょっと……\nそうだ、家に電話しなくちゃ。失礼します。", "zh": "你还有其他事情吗？我有点……\n对了，我得打电话回家，先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
